title: Neverland v1 — Unified Agents + Skills Platform Design (Apr 13)
summary: 'Completed full design and handoff spec for Neverland v1 — a unified public registry for AI Agents and Skills targeting May 1 launch. Key pivot: Neverland is an open standard platform for any AI tool, not a Paradigm-specific feature. Paradigm is the reference implementation. Spec written and handed off to implementation team.'
